// Phase 3 adoption (spec 0031): raw libc system()/getpid()/clock_gettime()
// call sites now go through std.sys (system_ref/pid/now_monotonic_ns).
// system_ref takes ptr[String] with named locals; it returns the ALREADY
// DECODED exit status (raw wait status had been leaking into returns until
// now).  mkdir()/access() stay fn-scoped raw externs until std.fs exists.
